.TH RADIO-PLAY 1 "2026-07-16" "gway-001" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
radio-play \- play remembered or browsed radio streams through Bluetooth audio
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B radio-play
.RI [ --pairing ]
.br
.B radio-play play
.RI [ name ]
.br
.B radio-play add
.I name url
.br
.B radio-play remove
.I name
.br
.B radio-play list
.br
.B radio-play device
.RI [ mac ]
.br
.B radio-play scan
.br
.B radio-play
.RI [ --pairing ]
.B --browser
.RI [ query ]
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B radio-play
.RI [ --pairing ]
.B --icecast
.RI [ query ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B radio-play
connects to Bluetooth headphones or speakers and plays either remembered
stations or browsed internet radio streams. Station names and logs are stored
under
.IR ~/.config/radio-play .
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BI play " NAME"
Play a remembered station. With no name, play the last station.
.TP
.BI add " NAME URL"
Add or update a remembered station.
.TP
.BI remove " NAME"
Remove a remembered station.
.TP
.B list
List remembered stations.
.TP
.BI device " MAC"
Show or set the remembered Bluetooth device.
.TP
.B scan
Scan and connect to Bluetooth headphones.
.TP
.BI logs " N"
Show recent browse/playback logs.
.TP
.B config
Show local config paths.
.SH BROWSE OPTIONS
.TP
.B --browser
Browse Radio Browser stations.
.TP
.B --icecast
Browse the Icecast/Xiph directory.
.TP
.BI --query " TEXT"
Search text, equivalent to a positional query.
.TP
.BI --limit " N"
Result count.
.TP
.BI --duration " 30s|10m|1h"
Rotate to the next station after this duration.
.TP
.B --list-only
List and log results without connecting or playing.
.TP
.B --save
Save played browsed stations locally.
.TP
.BI --country " US|MX"
Radio Browser country code filter.
.TP
.BI --tag " TAG"
Radio Browser tag filter.
.TP
.BI --language " LANGUAGE"
Radio Browser language filter.
.TP
.BI --codec " MP3|AAC"
Radio Browser codec filter.
.TP
.B --pairing
Allow scan/pairing when no paired headphones connect.
.SH EXAMPLES
Browse jazz stations in the US:
.PP
.nf
/home/arthe/.local/bin/radio-play --browser jazz --country US --limit 10
.fi
.PP
Browse and allow Bluetooth pairing:
.PP
.nf
/home/arthe/.local/bin/radio-play --pairing --browser jazz --country US --limit 10
.fi
.PP
Rotate ambient stations every 15 minutes and save played stations:
.PP
.nf
/home/arthe/.local/bin/radio-play --browser --tag ambient --duration 15m --save
.fi
.PP
Play a remembered station:
.PP
.nf
/home/arthe/.local/bin/radio-play play "Station name"
.fi
.PP
Show audio/Bluetooth config paths:
.PP
.nf
/home/arthe/.local/bin/radio-play config
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/radio-play/stations.tsv
Remembered station names and stream URLs.
.TP
.I ~/.config/radio-play/last-station
Last selected station.
.TP
.I ~/.config/radio-play/last-device
Remembered Bluetooth device.
.TP
.I ~/.config/radio-play/logs/events.tsv
Browse and playback log.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rfid-commands (1),
.BR sound-commands (1)
